OL,3,GNEWSASewage discharges cause 'toxic
OL,4,Acocktail' in rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSewage dumping in a county's waterways
OL,7,Fover the bank holiday weekend has
OL,8,Fcaused a "toxic and dangerous"
OL,9,Fbacterial "cocktail", a river
OL,10,Fcampaigner has said.
OL,12,FFollowing recent thunderstorms and
OL,13,Fshowers, Thames Water carried out storm
OL,14,Fdischarges at sites across Oxfordshire
OL,15,Fduring the three-day weekend.
OL,17,FCampaigner Ash Smith said the dumping
OL,18,Fwas "serious stuff", with rivers having
OL,19,F"very little capacity to dilute the
OL,20,Fhighly toxic untreated sewage" due to
OL,21,Flow water levels caused by the
OL,22,Frecord-breaking summer.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
