OL,3,GNEWSASewage discharges cause 'toxic
OL,4,Acocktail' in rivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Water said it takes its
OL,7,Fresponsibility to the environment "very
OL,8,Fseriously", and that the dry weather
OL,9,Fhad increased pressure on the
OL,10,Fwaste-water network.
